msgid "Keeps a line for each request of the kinds ticked here: when, who, the API call, the address, the result, how long it took and the request details with passwords, keys, tokens and card numbers hidden. The answer is never kept. Staff who may view the activity log find it under Activity > System Activity > API log. Nothing is kept while every kind is off."
